{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13208380","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13208380","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1320838001:1":{"text":"よほっ！やっぱりここにいたか。","source_cn":"嚯嚯，你们果然在这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39C9C169C9586809","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1320838002:1":{"text":"それにしても、なぜ予定していたルートを変更したんだ？","source_cn":"我很想知道，是什么原因让你们变更了原定计划上的路线。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E3689F42F3CE9DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320838003:1":{"text":"おお、フーキン先生。なんでまたここに？氷像を確認しに行ったんじゃねえのか？","source_cn":"呼金老师，你不是去检查冰雕情况了吗，怎么来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F76258D5F87B1B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320838004:1":{"text":"ついでに他の生産ラインも全部確認してきたんだが、どこも勤務態度はなっとらんし、工程も適当すぎる！","source_cn":"我顺便检查了所有的产线，无论工作态度，还是对流程的处理...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FD762ACD4B32822","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320838005:1":{"text":"それはそうと、なぜお前さんのところだけ、計画とは違うルートで来たんだ？","source_cn":"这么多人中只有你们没有按照原本的计划进行，变更了运输路...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x524E5DED93ADE4AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320838006:1":{"text":"ああ、それは実際に運搬を始めてみたら、山の気温が数十年前よりも上がってることに気付いたんだ。ほら、現に足元の河も完全に凍ってないだろ？","source_cn":"喔，是的，因为实际运输中，我们发现白山的气温较几十年前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEC8E416B8740A75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320838007:1":{"text":"だから船を使えば、運搬の効率が大幅に上がると思ってな！","source_cn":"如果用船运的话，可以大大提高运输的效率！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA757916EFD18D38F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320838008:1":{"text":"もちろん、事前に何度もテストしたし、規定通り、結果もちゃんと書類にまとめてあるぞ！","source_cn":"当然，这条路线我们已经测试很多次了，测试报告都整理归档...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x151A006A7EB14967","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320838009:1":{"text":"よほほほっ！素晴らしい！結果に問題がなければ、ワシもお前さんの案を支持するぞ！","source_cn":"……嚯哈哈哈哈！你的想法非常好！如果没问题的话我支持你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDC73A45C9F4DFBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320838010:1":{"text":"本当か？てっきり、工程の改変を渋ると思ったんだが……","source_cn":"真的吗？我们还担心你不愿修改流程呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A80B7157A6F5F6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_